      "col1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_1988470310": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:50:29 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #323232;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Total internal reflection:</span></span></span></span></p>\n<h3>Directs and shapes light</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Proprietary design controls, transmits and retains light</li>\n<li>Bends and shapes light to maximize its critical angle and prevent light from escaping</li>\n<li>Narrow and wide PhotonGuide tip designs further tailor light projection</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:51:56 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:49:30 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Solid core optical-grade polymer:</span></span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Couples and captures light</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Solid core polymer captures light from the source</li>\n<li>Eliminates light loss and thermal risks that can occur with fiber-to-fiber misalignment</li>\n<li>Creates a thermally-cool connection</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:52:55 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:49:30 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Refractive output surface:</span></span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Extracts and projects light</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Unique, refractive microlenses cover the outputsurface, extracting and directing light at varying angles</li>\n<li>Creates redundancy of light that eliminates shadows</li>\n<li>Mitigates masking by blood or fluids</li>\n<li>Minimizes backward glare</li>\n<li>Results in wider light projection</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:55:33 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
        "text_copy_232207016": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-5a4ae9843d@example.invalid",
          "jcr:created": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:49:30 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Intelligent Photonics:</span></span></span></p>\n<h3><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Delivers thermally-cool, volumetric lighting</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>At equal distance from target, delivers broader,volumetric light projection</li>\n<li>Generates thermally-cool illumination; maximum output temperature remains below established burn risk<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 19 2019 04:56:31 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
